Source: xpilot-infinity
Section: games
Priority: extra
Maintainer: Unofficial Debian XPilot <xpilot-hacks@lists.sourceforge.net>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 4.0.0), pkg-config, libx11-dev, libxext-dev, libsm-dev, libice-dev, zlib1g-dev, libexpat1-dev, libsdl3-dev (>= 3.2.0), libsdl3-image-dev (>= 3.2.0), libsdl3-ttf-dev (>= 3.2.0), libgl-dev, libopenal-dev, libalut-dev
Standards-Version: 3.6.2

Package: xpilot-infinity
Architecture: all
Depends: xpilot-infinity-client-x11 (= ${Source-Version}), xpilot-infinity-client-sdl (= ${Source-Version}), xpilot-infinity-server (= ${Source-Version}), xpilot-infinity-utils (= ${Source-Version})
Description: Multi-player tactical game for X (Infinity version)
 XPilot is a multi-player tactical manoeuvring game for X.  Each
 player controls their own fighter equipped with a variety of weapons
 and power-ups.  Players compete as teams or as individuals;  the
 object of the game is to score points by blasting the opposition,
 stealing their treasure or by racing round a circuit.
 WARNING: This game is very addictive.
 .
 This package is a complete XPilot installation, including the
 XPilot client, server and utilities.
 .
 This package is for the XPilot Infinity fork at http://xpilot.sf.net

Package: xpilot-infinity-common
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, adduser (>=3.34)
Suggests: xpilot-infinity-server, xpilot-infinity-utils, xpilot-infinity-client-x11, xpilot-infinity-client-sdl
Description: Common files for XPilot Infinity
 XPilot is a multi-player tactical manoeuvring game for X.  Each
 player controls their own fighter equipped with a variety of weapons
 and power-ups.  Players compete as teams or as individuals;  the
 object of the game is to score points by blasting the opposition,
 stealing their treasure or by racing round a circuit.
 WARNING: This game is very addictive.
 .
 This package contains the common files for the server, clients and
 utilities including both data and documentation.
 .
 This package is for the XPilot Infinity fork at http://xpilot.sf.net

Package: xpilot-infinity-client-x11
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, xpilot-infinity-common (= ${Source-Version})
Description: Client for XPilot Infinity
 XPilot is a multi-player tactical manoeuvring game for X.  Each
 player controls their own fighter equipped with a variety of weapons
 and power-ups.  Players compete as teams or as individuals;  the
 object of the game is to score points by blasting the opposition,
 stealing their treasure or by racing round a circuit.
 WARNING: This game is very addictive.
 .
 This package contains the classic client needed to play the game.
 Because it is X11-based, it is has a very basic, clean look-and-feel,
 and is suitable for use on older, less powerful systems.
 .
 This package is for the XPilot Infinity fork at http://xpilot.sf.net

Package: xpilot-infinity-client-sdl
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, xpilot-infinity-common (= ${Source-Version})
Description: Client for XPilot Infinity
 XPilot is a multi-player tactical manoeuvring game for X.  Each
 player controls their own fighter equipped with a variety of weapons
 and power-ups.  Players compete as teams or as individuals;  the
 object of the game is to score points by blasting the opposition,
 stealing their treasure or by racing round a circuit.
 WARNING: This game is very addictive.
 .
 This package contains a modern client with fancier graphics.  It is 
 suitable for use on modern systems with sufficient resources to run SDL 
 and GL.
 .
 This package is for the XPilot Infinity fork at http://xpilot.sf.net

